  "execution_rules": [
    "Check platform availability and account eligibility from the exact country on the measurement date; never infer availability solely from supported language or another product's market list.",
    "Record country, interface region, prompt language, answer language, platform, exact app surface, consumer UI/API, model/version, account state, search/grounding state, date/time UTC, prompt, full response, cited URLs and status.",
    "A product-unavailable result is a platform availability observation, not a zero-visibility score. An unsupported measurement provider is not a platform failure.",
    "Run brand/entity, generic commercial discovery, problem-solving, comparison and expertise intents separately. Generic prompts must not contain the brand name or a repository URL.",
    "Use natural local-language prompts; translate the intent, not mechanically the source sentence. Version and freeze each locale prompt set.",
    "Keep consumer UI and model API series separate. Keep Google AI Overviews and AI Mode separate from Gemini. Keep wrappers such as Poe separate from the underlying model.",
    "No paid checks, subscriptions, credits, API usage with cost, advertising or placements without explicit approval."
  ]
}
